     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Deuterium Extractor Tower\u00a7r is a much larger version of the Deuterium Extractor, making it an easy and viable way of making cheap fuel for the \u00a7b\u00a7r\u00a73Fusion Reactor\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72A Ferrouranium Anvil is required.\u00a7r",
