     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Leviathan Steam Turbine\u00a7r is a massive turbine capable of processing gargantuan amounts of \u00a7bSteam\u00a7r at once, only hindered by the fluid system's transfer rate. It is significantly more powerful than even the \u00a73Industrial Steam Turbine\u00a7r in terms of raw steam processing power. This turbine runs on \u00a7e85%\u00a7r Efficiency, so it is recommended that only 1-2 are used for very large reactors.",
