     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a7bAntimatter\u00a7r is a dangerous substance which can be obtained from a \u00a73Cyclotron\u00a7r or a \u00a73Particle Accelerator\u00a7r. If dropped on the floor a violent explosion will occur. Antimatter cant be stored in normal tanks, and as such, a \u00a73Magnetic Antimatter Container\u00a7r is required.",
