     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "For greater distances, and improved aesthetics, a new distribution node is available, the \u00a73Large Electricity Pylon\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a73Substations\u00a7r are needed to step up/down the voltage that the line carries.\n\nThese Pylons can prove useful as favorable \u00a7eBedrock Ore\u00a7r or \u00a7eOil deposits\u00a7r may be located far away from the main base.\n",
