     "particle_count:3": -1,
     "countAsQuest:1": 1,
     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Steel Furnace\u00a7r, unlike the other furnaces, runs off of \u00a7eTU\u00a7r. It can also process up to 3 items at a time, but each slot consumes more TU, which makes it slow without a strong heat source. It also has a bonus output for ores and wood, where every smelted item gives \u00a7e25%\u00a7r to the bonus output meter, which means every 4 items give an extra 5th item for free (\u00a7e+15 items from a single stack\u00a7r).",
