     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Mining Laser\u00a7r is a laser drill which can be used to quickly dig large areas. It has a \u00a7e100MHE\u00a7r internal power buffer and a 64,000mB internal \u00a7bCrude Oil\u00a7r buffer. Its default radius is 3, which can be increased by the use of an effectiveness upgrade. It can also be equiped with various upgrades to unlock new functions such as shredding or voiding.",
