     "name:8": "The Digamma Particle",
     "repeatTime:3": -1,
     "particle_count:3": -1,
     "countAsQuest:1": 1,
     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a7c\u00a7r\u00a74\u00a7r\u00a76Digamma Particle\u00a7r is created by colliding a \u00a76Sparkticle Capsule\u00a7r with a \u00a76Higgs Boson Capsule\u00a7r in a \u00a73Particle Accelerator\u00a7r. Making it in the particle accelerator will require \u00a76Chlorophyte Coils\u00a7r and a fourth loop, at a momentum of 70,000.\n\nThe digamma particle emits a different kind of radiation, \u00a74DRX\u00a7r, which currently can only be countered by the use of digamma medication, most notably \u00a76Enteramine Pills\u00a7r, which provide full immunity against DRX for 10 minutes. After the \u00a73DFC\u00a7r, Fau armor can be crafted which provides full resistance against DRX.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
