     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a76Neutrino Lens\u00a7r is an armor modification which can detect and highlight special blocks, such as \u00a7eBedrock Ore deposits\u00a7r, the \u00a76Pink Log\u00a7r and \u00a76Alexandrite\u00a7r. \n\nFor the lens to work, it must first be linked to a \u00a76Depth-Resource Scanning Module Satellite\u00a7r and then inserted into an armor piece using the \u00a73Armor Modification Table\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72The HUD key has to be activated for it to work.",
