     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Wood\u00a7r obtained from a tree farm can be smelted or processed in a \u00a73Combination Oven\u00a7r to produce \u00a76Charcoal\u00a7r, which has many uses, such as fuel for \u00a73Furnaces\u00a7r or even the \u00a73Blast Furnace\u00a7r, \u00a76Flux\u00a7r or \u00a76Carbon\u00a7r in a Crucible for \u00a76Steel\u00a7r production, or even \u00a76Gunpowder\u00a7r for ammunition.",
