     "desc:8": "\u00a73Pneumatic Pipes\u00a7r are an instant form of item transportation which can cover large distances. The pipes must have \u00a7bCompressed Pressurised Air\u00a7r, which can be created from taking compressed air from an \u00a73Air Intake\u00a7r and compressing it in a \u00a73Compressor.",
