     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Rubber\u00a7r is an essential material used in many crafting recipes. It is created in a \u00a73Chemical Plant\u00a7r with \u00a7bUnsaturated Hydrocarbons\u00a7r obtained from a \u00a73Catalytic Cracking Tower\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a76Latex\u00a7r is a rubber alternative which can be used in some recipes instead of normal rubber. It can be created early on using a \u00a73Burner Press\u00a7r by processing dandelions or jungle wood.",
