     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Strand Caster\u00a7r is a large basin that can cast items in batches of 9. It also requires \u00a7bWater\u00a7r in order to cast, where it makes \u00a7bLow-Pressure Steam\u00a7r that can be turned back into water.",
