     "desc:8": "The \u00a73PUREX\u00a7r is a machine that can reprocess depleted nuclear fuel into various materials. Most recipes require both \u00a7bNitric Acid\u00a7r and \u00a7bKerosene\u00a7r to function.\n\n\u00a76Schrabidium\u00a7r can also be extracted from certain recipes, which require \u00a7bSchrabidic Acid\u00a7r. The schrabidium extracted yields double the schrabidium used to make the acid.",
