     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Plasma Forge\u00a7r is a large and advanced assembler that requires a running fusion reactor to work. It can weld plates at twice the speed of a normal welder. It does not accept upgrades, however, it can use up otherwise useless fission fragments and unstable isotopes to gain a temporary \u00a7ex4\u00a7r speed bonus with no penalty.\n\n\u00a72With 3MTU/t plasma energy input, one can make pre-assembled fusion reactors with a discount.\u00a7r\u00a7r",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
     "confetti_icon:10": {
      "id:8": "minecraft:stick",
