     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "With the \u00a76\u00a73Automatic Buzz Saw\u00a7r one can automatically farm trees for their \u00a76Wood\u00a7r. If jungle trees are farmed, \u00a76Latex\u00a7r automation is also possible.\n\n\u00a73Fans\u00a7r, when powered by redstone, can be used to push the dropped items into hoppers or conveyors for storage. Use a \u00a76Drill\u00a7r on them to remove the diminishing pushing range.\n\n[F1] for more information.",
