     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Balefire\u00a7r is an extremely radioactive substance which can be used to make powerful fuels for the \u00a73RBMK\u00a7r, aswell as \u00a7bBF Rocket Fuel\u00a7r for power production. High radiation resistant equipment is needed to hold the item. \u00a76Thermonuclear Ashes\u00a7r can be produced sustainably as a byproduct from \u00a7bAntimatter - BF Rocket Fuel\u00a7r.\n\nThe High-Tech Bomb Defusing Device can extract balefire shards from duds.",
