     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Uranium-238\u00a7r is the most common uranium isotope in the game. \n\nThis material has many uses, some of which are: \u00a76Ferrouranium\u00a7r, MOX fuel, depleted uranium ammunition, absorber Pellets for the \u00a73Watz\u00a7r powerplant and can also be turned into \u00a76Schrabidium\u00a7r later on in the \u00a73Exposure Chamber\u00a7r.",
