     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Nuclear Waste Disposal Drum\u00a7r is used to decay \u00a73RBMK\u00a7r nuclear waste. The decayed nuclear waste can then be used with a \u00a73FEL\u00a7r and \u00a73SILEX\u00a7r to obtain some rare elements, such as \u00a76Bismuth\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72The drum also emmits radiation when theres fuel inside it.",
