     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Particle Accelerator\u00a7r is highly modular and as such has many parts, each serving a different function:\n\n\u00a73Particle Source\u00a7r: To create the particle.\n\n\u00a73Particle Detector\u00a7r (at a receiving end): To form the intended byproduct.\n\n\u00a73Quadrupole Magnets\u00a7r: To reduce particle defocus.\n\n\u00a73RF Cavities\u00a7r: For electromagnetic acceleration.\n\n\u00a73Dipole Magnets\u00a7r: For re-directing the particle.\n\n\u00a76Coils\u00a7r: For quadrupole and dipole magnets to function.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
