     "name:8": "Watz Powerplant",
     "repeatTime:3": -1,
     "particle_count:3": -1,
     "countAsQuest:1": 1,
     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Watz\u00a7r powerplant is a fission reactor which can produce \u00a7bPoisonous Mud\u00a7r, an important component of \u00a76CMB Steel\u00a7r. Although the reactor is not really powerful in terms of energy output, it can be stacked ontop of eachother for increased mud and power production.\n\nIf the poisonous mud buffer reaches its maximum, the reactor will melt down and explode, irradiating a wide area around it and causing fallout to fall in a small area around it. As well as this, it will spew poisonous mud in a very wide area which will then corrode any blocks that it comes in contact with, similar to corium.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
     "confetti_icon:10": {
