     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Presses\u00a7r are machines that can be used to make \u00a76Plates\u00a7r, \u00a76Wires\u00a7r, \u00a76Circuits\u00a7r, \u00a76Bullet Casings\u00a7r as well as \u00a76Compressing\u00a7r non-smeltable powders back into their normal form. They require \u00a76Stamps\u00a7r to work, which can be made from an \u00a73Anvil\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72A preheater can be placed next to the Burner Press to increase its speed.",
