     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a76Analog Circuit\u00a7r is the first true circuit board used in crafting certain essential machines and tools such as the \u00a76Oil Deposit Detector\u00a7r, the \u00a73Chemical Plant\u00a7r, and the \u00a73Electric Arc Furnace\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72A cheaper recipe for Capacitors will be available if a Shredder is owned.",
