     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Oil Derrick\u00a7r extracts \u00a7bCrude Oil\u00a7r and \u00a76\u00a7bNatural Gas\u00a7r from \u00a7eOil Deposits\u00a7r that are directly below them. When supplied with power, it will begin to drill downwards until it cannot drill further or reach an oil deposit. Upon reaching a deposit, it will continuously extract oil and gas from it until the deposit is entirely depleted.",
