     "desc:8": "The Martian Invasion Ship is a late-game boss which is killed to get the \u00a76UFO Coin\u00a7r, used in crafting Gerald.\n\nThis quest provides an alternative way of obtaining the coin.\n\n\u00a72This quest can be repeated.",
