     "desc:8": "Some steps will produce crumbs which can be further processed into more primary outputs in an arc furnace or electrolyzer, or combined into a full stack of 64 and washed with \u00a7bOre Slop\u00a7r to produce more unprocessed ore, which can be passed back into the system to yield even more ores.",
