     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a76Quantum Computer\u00a7r is the most powerful out of any other control unit. It  used to build \u00a76Gerald\u00a7r and the \u00a73DFC\u00a7r.",
