     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73ICF\u00a7r reactor is a very expensive and powerful reactor, which can produce a substantial amount of energy. Apart from the multiblock itself, \u00a73ICF Lasers\u00a7r must be constructed for the reactor to work. \u00a7bStellar Flux\u00a7r will be produced during its operation which is needed to craft \u00a76Gerald\u00a7r. Consider making use of \u00a7bLiquid Lead\u00a7r as it is a very efficient coolant for the ICF.\n\n\u00a72A Plasma Forge with a plasma input energy of 1MTU/t is required.\u00a7r\n\nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out as it has built-in calculators for the laser power consumption and the amount of hot coolant it produces.\n\n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/Inertial_Confinement_Fusion_Reactor[/url]",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
