     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Rotary Furnace\u00a7r is a large furnace which is powered by both \u00a7bSteam\u00a7r and \u00a76\u00a7rsolid fuel. \u00a7rIt outputs molten material which can be cast similarly to the outputs of the \u00a73Crucible\u00a7r and \u00a73Arc Furnace\u00a7r. The Rotary Furnace is the only machine that can produce \u00a76Saturnite\u00a7r and \u00a76Weapon Steel\u00a7r.",
