     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Poisonous Mud\u00a7r is the byproduct of the \u00a73Watz\u00a7r operating. This is the solidified version of it which can be used in a \u00a73Crucible\u00a7r to create \u00a76CMB Steel\u00a7r.",
