     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a76Crystalline Fullerite\u00a7r is an material which is primarely used in endgame machines, such as the \u00a73ICF\u00a7r and the \u00a73FEnSU\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72It is recommended that an Effectiveness 3 upgrade is installed on the Acidizer to increase the chance of not consuming the Fullerene, as fullerite can be expensive to produce large quantities.",
