     "desc:8": "The \u00a73DFC\u00a7r is the last reactor of the mod and as such is very expensive to craft. Apart from the DFC parts, two \u00a76Catalysts\u00a7r are needed for the reactor to work.\n\n\u00a72A Plasma Forge with a plasma input energy of 50MTU/t is required. Stellar Flux plasma is needed.\u00a7r\n\nIt is recommended that the wiki is checked out.\n\n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/DFC[/url]",
