     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Launch Pad\u00a7r is the main launch table for most missiles. Although it is the earliest available, missiles must first be erected before launch, resulting in a small delay.\n\nThe \u00a73Silo Launch Pad\u00a7r is a miniaturized version of the launch pad. It can launch every generic missile with a delay of only 5 seconds. A rusted variant can be found in the naturally-occurring silo structure, holding the damaged Doomsday Missile.",
