     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The most basic block for transmission is the \u00a73Red Copper Cable\u00a7r, which comes in two varieties, a block form and a skinnier cable form. The block form also has a paintable version which can help it blend into your designs better.\n\nFor better looking, aswell as longer distance energy transportation, a \u00a7l\u00a7r\u00a76Cable Drum\u00a7r with \u00a73Electricity Connectors\u00a7r can be used. These powerlines are non solid and can also pass through floors and walls.\n\n",
