     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Catalytic Reformer\u00a7r is an optional late-game oil processing machine. It converts certain oil products into more valuable ones.\n\nThe \u00a73Hydrotreater\u00a7r is another optional late-game oil processing machine that allows for easier production of \u00a7bSour Gas\u00a7r, which can also turn \u00a7bCrude Oil\u00a7r into \u00a7bDesulfurized crude Oil\u00a7r. \n\n\u00a72The Hydrotreater requires pressurized Liquid Hydrogen in all its recipes, requiring the use of a Compressor.",
