     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The first step to processing \u00a7eRaw Bedrock Ore\u00a7r straight out of the ground is to run it through a \u00a73Bedrock Ore Processor\u00a7r. This will split the raw ore into general types, with amounts depending on the location the ore was extracted and any effectiveness upgrades. These types are:\n\n\u00a7eLight Metal\u00a7r - common metals including \u00a76Iron/Copper\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7eHeavy Metal\u00a7r - heavier metals including \u00a76Tungsten/Lead\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7eRare Earth\u00a7r - rare earth metals including \u00a76Cobalt/Rare Earth\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7eActinide\u00a7r - radioactive heavy metals including \u00a76Uranium/Thorium\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7eNon-Metal\u00a7r - non-metallic ores including \u00a76Coal/Sulfur\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7eCrystalline\u00a7r - crystals including \u00a76Redstone/Cinnabar\u00a7r",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
