     "desc:8": "The \u00a73ICF\u00a7r can process different combinations of fuels at different laser power levels. A cheap and renewable fuel that can be used to gather the \u00a7bStellar Flux\u00a7r needed for \u00a76Gerald\u00a7r and make decent power is \u00a7bHelium-4 - Hydrogen\u00a7r.\n\nApplying a Muon Particle to a fuel pellet will decrease the power that is needed to run it.\n",
