     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Cyclotron\u00a7r is a machine that bombards element powders with element boxes to get heavier elements. Operating the machine will consume\u00a7e 20MHE/s\u00a7r.\n\nIt can also create \u00a7bAntimatter\u00a7r as a byproduct for certain operations, which makes it a reliable but expensive method of large-scale advanced material production.\n\n\u00a72Consider installing the highest level of Power Saving and Speed upgrades to reduce both recipe time and power consumption.\u00a7r",
