     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a72\u00a73PWR\u00a7r is a modular fission reactor. It is more limited than the \u00a73RBMK\u00a7r in terms of capability and fuel types but it is much safer and easier to use due to it melting down more gently and being far more stable in its operation.\n\nDue to the complex and expansive nature of the PWR, it is highly recommend that the wiki is checked out as it provides more information.\n\n[url]https://nucleartech.wiki/wiki/PWR[/url]\n\n\u00a72This quest demands the most essential parts of a PWR, and does not represent the amount needed for a functioning reactor. There are also many other types of PWR Components that can be used.",
