     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Pumpjack\u00a7r is a more efficient \u00a73Oil Derrick\u00a7r which extracts 750mb of \u00a7bCrude Oil\u00a7r and a random amount of \u00a7bNatural Gas\u00a7r between 50 and 250mb in a 1.25 second cycle. It depletes a single block of a deposit after extracting a random number of cycles of oil that is on average twice as large compared to the derrick.\n\nIn total, this means that the pumpjack is on average 3x as efficient at extracting oil and 3x as fast at doing so while producing the same amount of natural gas as the derrick.",
