     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "\u00a7bHigh-Performance Solvent\u00a7r is a solvent which is used in an \u00a73Ore Acidizer\u00a7r to further increase the products of bedrock ores, aswell as other recipes. It can be created from \u00a7bReformate Gas\u00a7r, from a \u00a73Vacuum Refinery\u00a7r, and \u00a7bChlorine\u00a7r in an \u00a73Industrial Mixer\u00a7r or be obtained from an \u00a73RBMK\u00a7r Irradiation Channel.\n\nTo transport High-Performance Solvent by hand, a \u00a76Hazardous Material Tank\u00a7r is needed.\n\n\u00a72High-Performance Solvent made from an RBMK irradiation channel requires an ore acidizer.\n",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
