     "desc:8": "Balls-O-Tron is the second boss of \u00a7dNTM\u00a7r. It can be summoned by interracting the mechanist's circle, found in the \u00a7eEnargite Temple\u00a7r which spawns in jungles, with a \u00a76Silver Key\u00a7r, made using the Maskman Coin, or from crafting the Balls-O-Tron spawn item.\n\nDue to the outdated nature of the bosses, aswell as the RNG needed to obtain some of the items, this quest provides an alternative way of obtaining the Balls-O-Tron coin.\n\n\u00a72This quest can be repeated.",
