     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Vacuum Refinery\u00a7r is an oil refinery which processes \u00a7bPressurized/Desulfurized Crude Oil\u00a7r into 4 liquid products. It is a good way to make \u00a7bHigh-Performance Solvent\u00a7r by using \u00a7bReformate Gas\u00a7r and \u00a7bChlorine Gas\u00a7r in an \u00a73Industrial Mixer\u00a7r.\n\n\u00a72Compressors are needed for the oil to be inserted inside the Vacuum Refinery.",
