     "simultaneous:1": 0,
     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a76ME Glass Cable - Fluix\u00a7r is a cable used to transmit data and energy between devices in an ME Network. It is capable of transmitting \u00a7f\u00a7e8 channels\u00a7r simultaneously.\n\nThe \u00a76Quartz Fiber\u00a7r is used to transfer energy, but not channels.\n\n\u00a76Cable Anchors\u00a7r can be used to seperate ME cable connections. They can also be used to make \u00a76Facades\u00a7r for the cables.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
