     "desc:8": "The Crafting CPU is a multiblock structure composed of \u00a73Crafting Co-Processing Units\u00a7r and \u00a73Crafting Storage\u00a7r. When placed next to eachother they form one CPU which is used when placing orders via \u00a73Interfaces\u00a7r. The more crafting co-processing units the more tasks the CPU can do in parallel while more crafting storage allows for bigger orders to be made.",
