     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a76Dense ME Fluix Cables\u00a7r can be used to transmit \u00a7e32 channels\u00a7r from an \u00a73ME Controller\u00a7r.\n\nOne controller is capable of connecting up to 6 dense cables, in turn each can branch off to 4 smaller cable lines connecting up to 192 ME devices to the network.\n\nThe \u00a76Smart Dense Cable\u00a7r also displays the amount of channels that are been used, but is known to be less performance friendly than the dense covered cables.\n\nIn addition there are 16 colored cables made with the appropriate dye. The colored cables allow contact with other cables without sharing the signal or connecting to any other cable but the ones of the same colour.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
     "confetti_icon:10": {
      "id:8": "minecraft:stick",
