     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73ME Export Bus\u00a7r is an ME component which is used to export items from the ME network into a machine or other input inventory. \n\nThe \u00a73ME Import Bus\u00a7r is an ME component which is used to import items directly into the ME Network from a machine or other output inventory.\n\n\u00a72It is recommended that Interfaces are used over Export/Import buses for performance reasons.",
