     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73ME Controller\u00a7r acts as the routing hub of an ME network. It has the ability to transmit data throughout the ME Network using \u00a7e32 channels\u00a7r per side. The \u00a76ME Dense Cable\u00a7r is the only cable that can support 32 channel simultaneously so it can be used as a main data line to connect to another ME Controller or branch off into 8 channel distribution lines via \u00a76ME Glass Cable\u00a7r, \u00a76ME Covered Cable\u00a7r (less lag)\u00a7r or \u00a76ME Smart Cable\u00a7r (displays the amount of channels used) to connect all the devices and multi-block structures in the network.",
     "completion_animation:8": "default",
