     "taskLogic:8": "AND",
     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73ME Storage Bus\u00a7r, when attached to an block/tile entity with an inventory (generally a storage unit, such as chests or a \u00a73Drawer Controller\u00a7r), will include that inventory's contents in the ME System.",
