     "autoClaim:1": 0,
     "globalShare:1": 0,
     "desc:8": "The \u00a73Security Terminal\u00a7r can be used to specify what players are allowed to interact with in the ME network which can be useful in multiplayer. It can also be used to link a \u00a76Wireless Terminal\u00a7r to the ME network. Atleast one \u00a73Wireless Access Point\u00a7r is required, and its range can be expanded using \u00a76Wireless Boosters\u00a7r.",
